Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:07.53,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure 居然超越了暗塌谷能量的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.90,0:00:10.52,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,看來時機已到
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.81,0:00:13.94,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,該我親自出面 御駕親征了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:19.47,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,還不是時候 在養好傷前 請避免參加戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.62,0:00:24.50,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,保護御體 是我的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.80,0:00:25.81,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,一人之下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.27,0:00:30.64,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你要搞清楚 我就只剩下你了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.92,0:00:41.53,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟發生什麼事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.19,0:00:46.52,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,大約在一小時前 於東面草原 打開了可疑的通道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.41,0:00:49.19,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,按照阿里利副隊長的說法...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.55,0:00:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們到的時候 眼前突然變得黑下來...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.49,0:00:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一招就敗了 等我們回過神來 通道已經消失不見了...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:04.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,現在能夠肯定的 是有什麼東西進入到藍天大地國內了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:04.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1400,965)}Skyland
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.52,0:01:07.88,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,要是是暗塌谷帝國的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:10.72,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不能放它進入城裡！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.28,0:01:12.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,且看英雄亮相！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)}{\c&HFCB856&\3c&HFFF4DE&\4c&HFFFFFF&}大公主與傳說中的Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.01,0:02:54.66,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡就是說的地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.49,0:02:58.30,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,敵人去哪裡了？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.85,0:03:08.56,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡很危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:11.01,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,快去安全的場所吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.55,0:03:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全的場所？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.64,0:03:16.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒有安全的地方了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.99,0:03:17.91,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.06,0:03:20.22,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,你在這裡做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.29,0:03:24.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看那個
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.90,0:03:26.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真氣派啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.78,0:03:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建立在悲傷眼淚之上的藍天大地城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:33.00,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:42.34,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我乃女帝·暗塌谷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:45.26,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷帝國的支配者
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.38,0:03:54.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,女帝·暗塌谷...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.79,0:03:59.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:03.88,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,蝴蝶！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:05.92,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,公主
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.83,0:04:09.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,我等了300年
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.82,0:04:14.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我一雪當年之恥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.39,0:04:16.40,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:22.27,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不要靠近小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.03,0:04:24.86,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 她剛才說的...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.47,0:04:26.38,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.53,0:04:27.99,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道點什麼嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.08,0:04:31.15,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:32.73,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.70,0:04:37.00,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道！一點都不知道！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:41.45,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,好！大伙上吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.99,0:04:43.25,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
