Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.35,0:08:56.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的力量 碰都碰不到我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.50,0:09:17.11,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.73,0:09:24.91,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,公主 這一切都怨你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:31.50,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空 沒有做壞事！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:33.36,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,別廢話了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:48.92,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.70,0:10:02.94,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！真白！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.53,0:10:04.79,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,起來！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.87,0:10:09.82,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:11.12,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,還有真白！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.18,0:10:15.82,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:17.46,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.94,0:10:19.05,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.98,0:10:25.69,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.74,0:10:35.15,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.74,0:10:39.29,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸 這裡是哪裡？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:40.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,王國都城？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.47,0:10:42.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:43.61,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.06,0:10:50.91,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.33,0:10:54.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.81,0:10:56.41,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:00.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然跑出來很危險的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.36,0:11:01.17,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小...小空
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.34,0:11:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？好神奇的交通工具 這是什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.21,0:11:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有受傷？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.72,0:11:09.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎喲 你一個人嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:14.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.05,0:11:16.06,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡是很大的城市 一不小心就會走散的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.05,0:11:22.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！我們會注意的！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:25.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然不曉得你是哪位貴人 給您添麻煩...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.02,0:11:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.32,0:11:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是打哪個鄉村來的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.95,0:11:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這位是公主殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地的天淚公主殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.86,0:11:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,\N{\an7}{\fs50}要解釋大公主的名字，先要再提一下小公主名字\N官方說法是寫作法語"elle(e)-她"，但是意義是希伯來語"el-神"\N同時有法語"ailes-翅膀"之意，按HK官方說法，還有希臘語"光明"\N之外還有擁抱裡也提過的英語"yell-阿花"、"air-天空"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.20,0:11:36.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,公主
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.70,0:11:37.80,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,天淚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:39.75,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,和小空的名字一樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.95,0:11:39.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,\N{\an7\}{\fs50}考慮到大公主和小公主名字部分相同的說法\N這裡選擇了air+rain的組合\N除此外之外還有+line、+rein等\N各兩兩組合，其中也不乏有諸多貼近作品背景的含義\N而大公主的原名則是"Elaine-伊萊恩"的變體\N指美麗的女性，也有光輝之人的含義
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.95,0:11:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呦 是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:42.94,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:44.72,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空也叫天空哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:46.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是個好名字呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.78,0:11:48.97,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,真白同學 你幫我分析一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.11,0:11:51.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 應該小晴給我分析一下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:54.75,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看... 這裡應該不是我們熟悉的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.90,0:11:55.63,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.93,0:12:00.02,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,出現了從沒見過的公主
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.19,0:12:00.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.37,0:12:07.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看你們似乎遇上了困難
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.48,0:12:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如若不嫌棄 不妨到城堡裡一聊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.33,0:12:19.59,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,請問 現在是藍天大地歷几幾年？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.77,0:12:22.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？當然是556年啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:25.01,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:27.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是300年前
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:28.65,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.55,0:12:38.28,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典是在向我們展示親歷的事件
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:41.22,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.01,0:12:54.76,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這是發生在暴風之夜的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:58.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗世界的魔物 向藍天大地發起進攻
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:12:59.94,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.63,0:13:02.87,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地的公主向天祈禱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.28,0:13:08.48,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,請天降英雄 奪回我們的藍天與人民的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.44,0:13:13.83,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是公主的祈禱傳達給了上蒼 勇敢的戰士·Precure挺身而出
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.26,0:13:16.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure拯救了藍天大地...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.73,0:13:21.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可思議的故事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.42,0:13:22.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.34,0:13:23.69,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不是故事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.85,0:13:26.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,這是真正發生過的...不對
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:29.08,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是即將在這裡上演的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.69,0:13:33.55,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,請相信我們！我們是從未來的藍天大地...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.77,0:13:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近的確是有未曾見過的魔物襲擊城市
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.32,0:13:43.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 大家齊心協力打倒了它
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.87,0:13:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 人類變身為英雄這種事...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.76,0:13:51.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我證明給你看！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.09,0:13:54.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:13:58.18,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:13:59.60,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,我也來！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.13,0:14:01.77,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.26,0:14:06.23,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:07.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.65,0:14:08.40,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:11.27,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯！海闊天空變身！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.43,0:14:14.50,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,咜！呀！嗒！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.68,0:14:16.65,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喵！嗒嗒嗒嗒嗒嗒！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.80,0:14:17.86,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:21.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請用這間陋室
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.17,0:14:24.42,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,膩害！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.00,0:14:28.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝你 天淚公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.39,0:14:30.31,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.43,0:14:32.14,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,不是在叫小空
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:34.38,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是那位公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.87,0:14:38.48,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不對 小空才是公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:40.59,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,公主是小空
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:45.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸... 兩位都是公主 兩位也都叫天空
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.18,0:14:49.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,連我都要分不清楚了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:53.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 你們晚安 小公主
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.67,0:14:55.72,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,好 晚安！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.95,0:15:00.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未來的這個國家是怎麼樣的？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.18,0:15:02.23,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:08.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,欸...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.51,0:15:10.76,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,是個好地方 充滿了活力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.48,0:15:13.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,國民們既善良又勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:14.99,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,還有還有！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.13,0:15:16.68,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都和睦相處
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:17.74,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:21.68,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,人族 鳥族和龍族 大家攜手共進 安居樂業
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:26.34,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我們想要保護這美妙的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.50,0:15:28.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,為此我們在戰鬥著
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.26,0:15:33.09,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Precure的力量 是保護重要的事物的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.76,0:15:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在相信你們所生活的未來藍天大地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.45,0:15:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信你們是Precure了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.10,0:15:45.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天再跟我慢慢聊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.12,0:15:47.06,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,是！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.54,0:15:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（雷鳴聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.56,0:16:04.31,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,力量才是一切
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.50,0:16:08.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弱肉強食是宿命
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:09.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,前進！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.01,0:16:12.35,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.95,0:16:16.21,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.97,0:16:19.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（鐘聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.84,0:16:23.16,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.94,0:16:30.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,吾名皇帝·暗塌谷
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.61,0:16:33.22,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷帝國的支配者
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.54,0:16:38.84,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,前來蹂躪這個只有弱者在蠕動的毫無價值世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.19,0:16:43.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴獸！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:45.36,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.52,0:16:47.53,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,無法變身成Precure 就沒辦法戰鬥！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快去避難！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.94,0:16:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（慘叫）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.17,0:16:55.37,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,小空拜託你們了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:56.39,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.72,0:16:58.92,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:06.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,不能坐視不管！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.41,0:17:08.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:12.25,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.67,0:17:15.60,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,你快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.79,0:17:17.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.91,0:17:19.72,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我來會會你！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.88,0:17:20.86,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.07,0:17:23.30,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,只會欺負弱者的卑鄙小人！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:25.42,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.96,0:17:29.20,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有Precure的力量 就無法淨化亂暴獸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.77,0:17:31.47,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 應該有我力所能及的！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:33.74,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.82,0:17:49.79,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,啦... 啦啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:53.60,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.93,0:17:54.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.82,0:17:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:58.24,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:02.42,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,別停下腳步 英雄少女！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.03,0:18:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.77,0:18:10.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（掌聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.58,0:18:13.23,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,弱者也挺努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.46,0:18:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是弱是強 我們切磋一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.21,0:18:20.73,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼... 來吧 暗塌谷能量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.07,0:18:28.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.06,0:18:30.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:33.48,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷能量是最強的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.86,0:18:38.11,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不要做夢 能夠與之相抗衡了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.83,0:18:47.45,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哈哈哈哈哈哈... 哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.85,0:18:51.92,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃往城外！城裡已經不安全了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:53.16,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:57.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.17,0:18:58.73,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,我來拖延時間！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:10.13,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,亂暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:11.47,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,小晴！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴雯麗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.87,0:19:21.87,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.02,0:19:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要衝過去了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.59,0:19:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完了... 我們無法抵禦那些怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.84,0:19:41.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經無路可退了...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.35,0:19:45.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（抽泣聲）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.91,0:19:51.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保護重要事物的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.40,0:20:01.65,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,公主？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.49,0:20:21.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天大地的公主向天期待
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.27,0:20:27.00,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,請天降英雄 奪回我們的藍天與人民的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.58,0:20:32.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是公主的祈禱傳達給了上蒼 勇敢的戰士挺身而出
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.83,0:20:34.30,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,其名喚作...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.79,0:20:38.61,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,小空...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.31,0:21:03.11,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,傳說中的Precure 並非是響應了公主的祈禱
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.44,0:21:07.84,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,公主就是傳說中的Precure本身啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.53,0:21:10.41,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,公主...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.97,0:21:14.00,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,不 從今天起我就是Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:16.20,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,崇高降世的神秘
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.35,0:21:17.80,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Cure Noble
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.35,0:21:17.80,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}高尚愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.49,0:21:26.66,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是Precure的誕生...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.31,0:21:32.79,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,神威大典 你還打算讓我們見證什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.73,0:21:38.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就到這裡了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.46,0:21:39.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父皇
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.75,0:21:40.66,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.95,0:21:43.67,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,應該命令過你 不要來戰場
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:44.80,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.89,0:21:49.72,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,還有你 一人之下 你這個上不了戰場的文職教員！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.94,0:21:51.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,非常慚愧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.31,0:21:55.61,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我們回帝國去吧 未來的女帝殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.10,0:21:57.76,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,哼！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.28,0:22:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭只會催生出眼淚啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.73,0:22:10.51,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是我 Cure Majesty！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.73,0:22:10.51,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50\pos(1090,970)}威愛愈衛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.78,0:22:13.95,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 要和我一起跳哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.24,0:23:50.20,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,來到300年前的藍天大地的我們
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.36,0:23:53.08,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,在那裡遇到的 是傳說中的Precure！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.34,0:23:55.44,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,過去究竟發生過什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.65,0:23:58.33,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 那個人 難道她是！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:01.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,Hirogaru Sky！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.54,0:24:01.12,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs50}海闊天空！光之美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.12,0:24:04.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,暗塌谷帝國的善良少女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:16.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}（衝上藍天！）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.45,0:01:22.01,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 超越雲巔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.22,0:01:27.56,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,飛吧！向著海闊天空的世界 Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.56,0:01:35.30,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（晴空萬里 美麗藍天 翱翔吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.50,0:01:40.45,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,雨後初霽天空稜鏡折射出彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.70,0:01:44.67,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,藍天的景色預告著有好事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.67,0:01:46.17,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,（藍天的景色）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.17,0:01:50.48,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要確認一下 便伸直了雙手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:55.07,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住了名為希望的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.13,0:01:57.03,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,秒速緊握！緊緊握住！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.13,0:02:01.62,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,戰勝絕望吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.97,0:02:05.57,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我們能堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.57,0:02:08.96,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}擦乾眼淚
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:08.96,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}（你已經做好準備了嗎）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:10.98,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(700,1070)}飛躍而起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:10.98,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,0)}{\pos(1090,1070)}(讓我們張開勇氣之翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.31,0:02:16.69,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,振翅高飛 朝氣蓬勃
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.90,0:02:21.37,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,把煩躁化為光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.57,0:02:26.66,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,未知的世界 未來的圖景 充滿著可能
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.85,0:02:31.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,與在同一片藍天下的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:34.21,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,一起喚起通向明日的奇蹟！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:42.24,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,英雄少女 海闊天空！Precure
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
